      "name": "latex-build-cache",
      "title": "LaTeX build performance — findings + what's safe",
      "description": "LaTeX build performance. What works is the iterative loop: a static preflight with no TeX, Tool `tex-install` for an engine, Tool `paper-feature-build` for quick changed-chapter builds with latexdiff, then the full build. Both standard preamble/diagram caching mechanisms failed on this toolchain, so there is no cache; read the negative results before attempting one.",
